## Delegation Definitions

{%- if artifact.delegationDefinitions.size > 0 %}
Dynamic subagents are defined from `delegation-definitions/index.json` and invoked with cached `TypeName` values keyed by rp1 agent id plus definition hash.
{%- for definition in artifact.delegationDefinitions %}
